        "id": 1260470
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-03-05T21:02:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I moved power_reset_host_sleep_state() into intel_x86.c because I didn\u0027t like the intel-specific ifdefs polluting common.c, and I could make my own variables static (which I subsequently forgot to do) if I moved it. But unfortunately that meant I had to expose host_sleep_state since power_reset_host_sleep_state() clears it.",
      "parentUuid": "09ed36b1_6a158483",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 226,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 226,
        "endChar": 46
      },
      "revId": "01af02670e8db2673242e01b7dd0c613a11860f4",
